    "detailed_description": "A Sci-fi Arcade shooter<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlanet Earth is in danger, you are a new recruit who will have to face off with a race of Irisians<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete missions to progress the game, missions are made up of a few 1-2 min sections, once all sections are complete, all minerals and health data will be stored for another mission,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock new ships by gathering and exchanging minerals, each ship is unique, you will have a different experience when playing different ships<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock new skills by gathering and exchanging minerals, some skills are designed for specific enemies, some are just general use like adding shield<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSame mission can be played multiple times to gather more minerals<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMini-bosses every few missions,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThree minigames will be unlocked upon game completion, play with friends for highest score<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are able to play your own music during missions, in Main Menu, press &quot;Options&quot; and then &quot;?&quot; located next to &quot;Mission song&quot; section to check where music should be dropped",
